            <ArticleTitle>Introducing an acute pain service.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>15-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article introduces the concept of an acute pain service (APS). It describes the initial steps needed in setting up such a service, the key areas that an APS focuses on and ways in which an APS might later expand.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
